## Best Practices

### 1. Type Your sx Props

```typescript
import type { SxProps, Theme } from '@mui/material';

// ✅ Good
const styles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>> = {
  container: { p: 2 },
};

// ❌ Avoid
const styles = {
  container: { p: 2 }, // No type safety
};
```

### 2. Use Theme Tokens

```typescript
